OL,5,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FFirearms officers enter a property
OL,7,     Fto discover an arsenal of weapons
OL,8,     Fand a recently harvested cannabis
OL,9,     Fcrop, and suspicions are aroused
OL,10,     Fby a lad in a balaclava on a sunny
OL,11,     Fday.
OL,12,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FFollowing the work of the Firearms
OL,14,     FSquad. The team respond to reports
OL,15,     Fof a shotgun changing hands in the
OL,16,     Fsuburbs. When the team swoops in,
OL,17,     Fboth buyer and seller are taken by
OL,18,     Fsurprise.
